<PageTitle>Settings mockups</PageTitle>

<h3>Settings mockups (issue #258)</h3>
<p>Three layout options for the Settings page. They use sample data and nothing is saved.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="settings-mockup/a">Option A: Tabs</a>, one tab per group.</li>
    <li><a href="settings-mockup/b">Option B: Cards</a>, every group in a bordered card on one page.</li>
    <li><a href="settings-mockup/c">Option C: Accordion</a>, collapsible sections with a one-line summary.</li>
</ul>
